        "代 $x=0$（$e^0=1$）：",
        "例：$y''-3y'+2y=0$，$y(0)=0$，$y'(0)=1$",
        "$C_2=1$，$C_1=-1$",
        "檢查：$y(0)=1-1=0$，$y'(0)=2-1=1$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "y=C_1e^{r_1x}+C_2e^{r_2x}",
        "\\begin{aligned}C_1+C_2&=y(0)\\\\r_1C_1+r_2C_2&=y'(0)\\end{aligned}",
        "\\begin{aligned}C_1+C_2&=0\\\\C_1+2C_2&=1\\end{aligned}",
        "y=e^{2x}-e^x"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 根是 $\\pm1$",
      "body": [
        "$y''-y=0$，$y(0)=2$，$y'(0)=0$",
